[I] Determine the locale encoding

[T] Encode::Locale is a Perl module that tries to determine what encodings
[T] should be used when interfacing with external interfaces such as the
[T] terminal, file names and the command line. It defines encoding aliases
[T] like locale and console_out for use with Encode.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Encode-Locale

